    {
      "id": "spring-boot-application-lesson-1-point-1",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "richText": [
        [
          "These provide application configuration, discovery of application components, and Boot\u2019s automatic framework configuration."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "spring-boot-application-lesson-1-point-2",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "richText": [
        [
          "The annotation enables these features on the class. "
        ],
        [
          "SpringApplication.run",
          [
            [
              "c"
